  "prefLabel": "Puc 2001.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2001.01 Purpose. The purpose of Puc 2000 is to establish a procedure, in addition to Puc 200, to adjudicate the department of energy’s petitions alleging sanctionable events and the transfer of customer complaints against competitive electric power suppliers and aggregators registered with the department of energy under RSA 374-F:7 and En 2000.\n\nSource. #7758, eff 9-4-02; ss by #9774-A, eff 8-26-10; ss by #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36",
